@startuml
title WAGI – Gesamtarchitektur
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor "Normaler WhatsApp-Nutzer" as User
component "wa-connector\nNode.js + Baileys" as Connector
actor "Telegram-Gruppe / Channel" as Telegram
component "tg-connector\nNode.js + Telegram Bot API" as TgConnector
component "NATS JetStream" as Bus
database "PostgreSQL\nPostGIS + pgvector" as DB
component "Go API" as API
component "Next.js Dashboard" as Web
component "media-worker\nWhisper/faster-whisper" as Media
component "ai-worker\nRelevance/Facts/Events" as AI
storage "MinIO" as S3

User --> Connector : Linked Device / QR
Connector --> DB : Gruppen + Nachrichten
Connector --> Bus : wa.* events
Telegram --> TgConnector : Bot-Mitgliedschaft
TgConnector --> DB : Gruppen + Nachrichten
TgConnector --> Bus : wa.* events
Bus --> Media : media.audio.requested
Media --> S3 : Medien lesen/schreiben
Media --> Bus : media.audio.transcribed
Bus --> AI : wa.messages / transcripts
AI --> DB : strukturierte Analysen
Web --> API : REST/JSON
API --> DB
API --> Bus : Audio-Jobs
note right of Connector
Adapter-Schicht hält die
inoffizielle WhatsApp-Integration
austauschbar.
end note
note right of TgConnector
Bot-Token, Long Polling und
persistenter Offset-State.
Gruppen/Channels werden nur
bei Bot-Mitgliedschaft gesehen.
end note
@enduml
